%[text] %[text:anchor:H_25F89626] ## Glossary
%[text] %[text:anchor:M_83b7] **Feature Engineering**: changing how predictors enter the model so the linear regression assumptions are more reasonable. [(↑ Return to Text)](internal:M_5204)
%[text] %[text:anchor:M_2813] **Residuals Plot**: a plot that displays residuals on the y‑axis against the model’s fitted values on the x‑axis, with a horizontal zero line indicating perfect predictions. [(↑ Return to Text)](internal:M_58a8)
%[text] %[text:anchor:M_11ac] **Multiple Regression:** a regression technique that uses two or more independent variables to predict a single dependent variable. [(↑ Return to Text)](internal:M_8de8)
%%
